{"4202610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chug It 🍺", "steam_appid": 4202610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/d5d91eec0810f10f983edcbdb7015a53.poster.avif?t=1785772781\" width=800 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/d5d91eec0810f10f983edcbdb7015a53.webm?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/d5d91eec0810f10f983edcbdb7015a53.mp4?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chug It takes place in an adorable fantasy world, and your job is to run your very own tavern. Exciting, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can bring friends along too, co-op works with up to 4 players. Cook food, prepare drinks, and serve all kinds of fantasy folk. Oh, and you grow your own ingredients. Yep, no buying ingredients in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everything is 100% locally produced.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farming 🥕</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start each day on your backyard farm, tending your crops and looking after your animals. Everything you grow ends up in your recipes, from the carrots in the stew to the grapes in your wine.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/69a637a38b72cd3da1a8daae30a1c6ac.poster.avif?t=1785772781\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/69a637a38b72cd3da1a8daae30a1c6ac.webm?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/69a637a38b72cd3da1a8daae30a1c6ac.mp4?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run Your Own Tavern 🍲</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open and close the tavern whenever you feel like it. Every dish is made by hand and every drink is poured by you. Serve humans, elves, orcs, and whoever else walks through the door. Keep the pantry stocked, earn gold, and build up your reputation.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/e48a8ac329b359b6efcafc43b37649dc.poster.avif?t=1785772781\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/e48a8ac329b359b6efcafc43b37649dc.webm?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/e48a8ac329b359b6efcafc43b37649dc.mp4?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Upgrade &amp; Decorate 🏡</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your gold to expand the tavern, unlock new cooking stations, and decorate the place however you like. And when the chores start piling up? Build yourself some golem helpers.  They work for free.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/ff9c81f05bd1f88cd02f912e462cdf14.poster.avif?t=1785772781\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/ff9c81f05bd1f88cd02f912e462cdf14.webm?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/ff9c81f05bd1f88cd02f912e462cdf14.mp4?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/d5d91eec0810f10f983edcbdb7015a53.poster.avif?t=1785772781\" width=800 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/d5d91eec0810f10f983edcbdb7015a53.webm?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/d5d91eec0810f10f983edcbdb7015a53.mp4?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chug It takes place in an adorable fantasy world, and your job is to run your very own tavern. Exciting, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can bring friends along too, co-op works with up to 4 players. Cook food, prepare drinks, and serve all kinds of fantasy folk. Oh, and you grow your own ingredients. Yep, no buying ingredients in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Everything is 100% locally produced.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farming 🥕</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start each day on your backyard farm, tending your crops and looking after your animals. Everything you grow ends up in your recipes, from the carrots in the stew to the grapes in your wine.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/69a637a38b72cd3da1a8daae30a1c6ac.poster.avif?t=1785772781\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/69a637a38b72cd3da1a8daae30a1c6ac.webm?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/69a637a38b72cd3da1a8daae30a1c6ac.mp4?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run Your Own Tavern 🍲</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open and close the tavern whenever you feel like it. Every dish is made by hand and every drink is poured by you. Serve humans, elves, orcs, and whoever else walks through the door. Keep the pantry stocked, earn gold, and build up your reputation.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/e48a8ac329b359b6efcafc43b37649dc.poster.avif?t=1785772781\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/e48a8ac329b359b6efcafc43b37649dc.webm?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/e48a8ac329b359b6efcafc43b37649dc.mp4?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Upgrade &amp; Decorate 🏡</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your gold to expand the tavern, unlock new cooking stations, and decorate the place however you like. And when the chores start piling up? Build yourself some golem helpers.  They work for free.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/ff9c81f05bd1f88cd02f912e462cdf14.poster.avif?t=1785772781\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/ff9c81f05bd1f88cd02f912e462cdf14.webm?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202610/extras/ff9c81f05bd1f88cd02f912e462cdf14.mp4?t=1785772781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_descript